  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Budgetst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning till Tanzania 2013-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General Budget Support (GBS) for poverty reductionin Tanzania 2013-2015 - Two year GBS contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den f&#xf6;reslagna insatsen omfattar ett tv&#xe5;-&#xe5;rigt svenskt &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsavtal f&#xf6;r Generellt Budgetst&#xf6;d (GBS), juli 2013- juni 2015, Intentionen &#xe4;r  att under denna omst&#xe4;llningstid utveckla ett resultatbaserat          utbetalningsinstrument d&#xe4;r svenska utbetalningar relateras till       relevanta resultatomr&#xe5;den i den nya strategin och p&#xe5; ett s&#xe4;tt som     ocks&#xe5; kan samexistera med vad andra givare utvecklar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed action includes a two-year Swedish transition agreement  for General Budget Support (GBS), July 2013 - June 2015, the          intention is that during this time develop a performance-based        payment instrument where Swedish payments related to the relevant     performance areas in the new strategy in a way that can also coexist  with what other donors develops.</narrative>
  </description>
